<h2>Development Plan</h2>

<p>This work is ongoing and will be prioritized in a future update: </p>
<ul>
<li>solicitation and publication of descendant stories </li>
<li>registration transcriptions for Cumberland, Lancaster, and Washington counties </li>
<li>a timeline of key dates in the history of Pennsylvania slavery and abolition </li>
</ul>
 

<p>This work, by contrast, will require additional funding: </p>

<ul>
<li>registration transcriptions across the entire database </li>
<li>high-quality scans of original documents </li>
<li>a more flexible database schema, including dynamic faceting </li>
</ul>

<h2>Colophon</h2>
<p>A Just and True Return runs from a MySQL database. Registry transcripts are stored in HTML. </p>  
<p>The interface was developed using <a href="https://github.com/mevdschee/php-crud-api">PHP-CRUD-API</a>, <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro 5</a>, and <a href="https://getbootstrap.com/">Bootstrap 5</a>, with search ranking supported by <a href="https://www.fusejs.io/">Fuse.js</a>. Data visualizations were created with <a href="https://d3js.org/">D3.js</a>.</p>
<p>The font used is Noto Serif.</p>

</PageLayout>
